  "journal": {
    "valley": {
      "title": "Into the Valley",
      "text": "Awakening Valley from the edge: a river deep in its gorge and one old bridge across it. Bram complained about the supplies; I said we could build a bridge. Half of the old one fell as we reached it and nearly took our crate with it, so we did build some. We made camp on the east bank, found three of the old survey markers with Orin's compass and picked berries for the way back. From the overlook the needle swung toward a campsite further east. Somebody has been out here."
    }
